    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "place",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "text": "A write to any of them is handled by IMF_Write, on the build that is not PC-98.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
       "lines": "724-726",
       "sha": "041d37b7406a993cf2fd95feb71a29f9de6b6841838f1b969e8dab42a8584ac1"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
       "lines": "746-752",
       "sha": "3906a8b47068a12b898000c5bd13b423f14afe0cb0aa40721a117ac718f65fe0"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
       "lines": "753-761",
       "sha": "136c704d5247788f83b05f6d04ecc23548cd54954b8f84e518284f81ce6ba5aa"
      }
     ],
     "vs": "place"
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "text": "IMF_Write only logs the port and the byte; the write changes nothing.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
